    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23398" root="شوه" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُوهَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Remoteness:</i> (K, TA:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُوهَةٌ</span>: one
says, in dispraise, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُوهَةً لَهُ وَبُوهَةً</span> [i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُعْدًا لَهُ</span>, lit.
<i>Remoteness to him!</i> meaning <i>may God alienate
him</i> or <i>estrange him, from good,</i> or <i>prosperity!</i>
or, <i>curse him!</i>]. (TA.)

